		         ust.hk.praisehk.metamodelcalibration.transit.fare
		             FareCalculator.java
		             FareLink.java

		     Exactly TWO classes were needed. The fork's transitive closure was
		     measured at 39 files / 11,024 LOC, but only FareCalculator (21 active
		     references) and FareLink (31) have any active use; the other four
		     referenced classes were import-only and the remaining 33 closure
		     files are unused. The fork is therefore no longer a build dependency
		     at all, and six further classes (MTRFareCalculator,
		     ZonalFareCalculator, TransitStop, TransitFareHandler,
		     TransferDiscountCalculator, RouteHelper) were deliberately NOT
		     vendored.
